{"articleNo":"2142","sourceUrl":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_03.do?mode=view&articleNo=2142&article.offset=0&articleLimit=10","title":"건전한 식생활 및 체중관리 모범수기 공모전 안내","writer":"국립금오공과대학교","writeDate":"2011.11.22","hit":"8492","attachments":[{"name":"안내문4.hwp","href":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_03.do?mode=download&articleNo=2142&attachNo=69229"}],"contentHtml":"\n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n                \n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<!--StartFragment-->&nbsp; <span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">진주시에서는&nbsp;건전한&nbsp;식생활&nbsp;및&nbsp;체중관리&nbsp;모범수기&nbsp;공모전을&nbsp;아래의&nbsp;내용과&nbsp;같이&nbsp;개최한다하오니&nbsp;관심있는 학생은 참여 하시기&nbsp;바랍니다.&nbsp;</span>\n<p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: left; MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">&nbsp;1.&nbsp;공모기간&nbsp;:&nbsp;2011.&nbsp;11.&nbsp;09(수)&nbsp;~&nbsp;12.&nbsp;02(금)&nbsp;&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: left; MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">&nbsp;2.&nbsp;응모대상&nbsp;:&nbsp;제한없음&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: left; MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">&nbsp;3.&nbsp;응모내용&nbsp;:&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: left; MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;-&nbsp;건전한&nbsp;식생활과&nbsp;적정체중유지의&nbsp;중요성을&nbsp;일깨우는&nbsp;경험&nbsp;및&nbsp;사례&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: left; TEXT-INDENT: 6pt; MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">&nbsp;-&nbsp;과식과&nbsp;편식을&nbsp;지양하고,&nbsp;바람직한&nbsp;식습관을&nbsp;형성하여&nbsp;건강한&nbsp;삶을&nbsp;살아가는&nbsp;사례&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: left; TEXT-INDENT: 6pt; MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">&nbsp;-&nbsp;계획된&nbsp;열량&nbsp;내에서&nbsp;식품을&nbsp;골고루&nbsp;섭취하고,&nbsp;규칙적인&nbsp;운동&nbsp;등&nbsp;신체활동증진으로&nbsp;체중&nbsp;조절에&nbsp;성공한&nbsp;소감&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: left; TEXT-INDENT: 6pt; MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;(진주시청홈페이지&nbsp;또는,&nbsp;진주시보건소&nbsp;홈페이지&nbsp;참조)&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: left; MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;; FONT-SIZE: 11.8pt\">&nbsp;4.&nbsp;접수기간&nbsp;:&nbsp;2011.&nbsp;11.&nbsp;21(월)&nbsp;~&nbsp;12.&nbsp;02(금)&nbsp;18:00까지&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: left; MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">&nbsp;5.&nbsp;접&nbsp;수&nbsp;처&nbsp;:&nbsp;우편&nbsp;또는&nbsp;인편접수(건강증진과)&nbsp;☎055)&nbsp;749-&nbsp;4939&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: left; MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;진주시&nbsp;진양호로&nbsp;476번지&nbsp;(남성동&nbsp;3-18번지)&nbsp;건강증진과&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: left; MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">&nbsp;6.&nbsp;시&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;상&nbsp;&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: left; MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;-&nbsp;훈&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;격&nbsp;:&nbsp;진주시장&nbsp;상장&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: left; MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;-&nbsp;시상금&nbsp;:&nbsp;최우수&nbsp;30만원,&nbsp;우수&nbsp;20만원,&nbsp;장려&nbsp;10만원.&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: left; MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림체&quot;; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">붙임&nbsp;:&nbsp;건전한&nbsp;식생활&nbsp;및&nbsp;체중관리&nbsp;모범수기&nbsp;공모&nbsp;게시문&nbsp;1부.&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;끝.</span></p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n            "}
